source: tools/junius/tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout
---
Plugin inspection and lifecycle

Usage: junius plugin [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list     List enabled plugins in a deployment config
  info     Show a plugin's manifest summary
  enable   Add a plugin to platform.toml. (Stub — lands in M11.)
  disable  Remove a plugin from platform.toml. (Stub — lands in M11.)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format for command results [default: plain] [possible values: plain, json]
  -v, --verbose...       Increase verbosity (repeat for more)
      --cwd <CWD>        Run as if junius were started in <CWD>
  -h, --help             Print help
